cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "pubkit: publish one source to many platforms, safely"
message: If you use this software, please cite it.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Singh
    given-names: Arun
repository-code: https://github.com/arunsingh/pubkit
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-09-11
keywords: [publishing, automation, content, browser-automation, python]
abstract: >-
  A publishing pipeline that treats cross-platform publishing as a distributed
  systems problem: an unreliable channel, a stateful remote you do not control,
  and a non-idempotent operation. Provides a canonical document IR, capability
  negotiation with explicit degradations, hash-verified transport, reload-based
  verification, and a resumable idempotent runner. Adapters for Medium,
  Substack, X, Dev.to and Hashnode.
